    concept:
      'A **list comprehension** builds a new list from an existing sequence in a single expression:\n\n`[expression for item in sequence]`\n\nRead it left to right: "give me this expression, for each item". It replaces the three-line create-empty-list-then-append pattern and reads much closer to the intent.\n\nThe expression can be anything: arithmetic, a method call, an f-string, even another comprehension.',
