    example: 'colours = ["red", "green", "blue"]\n\nfor i, colour in enumerate(colours):\n    print(i, colour)\n\nfor i, colour in enumerate(colours, start=1):\n    print(f"{i}. {colour}")\n\nnames = ["ada", "bob"]\nscores = [91, 78]\nfor name, score in zip(names, scores):\n    print(name, score)\n\nprint(dict(zip(names, scores)))',
