    solution: 'def to_number(text):\n    try:\n        return int(text)\n    except ValueError:\n        return "invalid"\n\nfor t in ["42", "3.5", "abc"]:\n    print(to_number(t))',
    hint: 'int("3.5") raises ValueError too, because the string is not a whole number.',
